                     <note>Translated by <persName type="standard" xml:lang="ar-Latn-x-lc"
                           key="person_36906875" ref="http://www.viaf.org/viaf/36906875/" role="trl"
                           change="#role-assignment">Qusṭā ibn Lūqā, <date calendar="#Gregorian"
